# The 3D PC worker's LAN address, read by on-3dpc.sh, test-on-3dpc.sh and local3d.mjs (one place to change it).
# It moved from 192.168.0.9 to 192.168.0.8 after the 2026-10-18 power cut (DHCP gave .9 to another device).
# Find it again by scanning for the pipeline: for i in $(seq 1 40); do curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code} $i\n" --max-time 0.8 http://192.168.0.$i:8082/health; done | grep -v ^000
WORKER_IP=192.168.0.8
